      "text": "Let \\( f \\) be the function given by \\( f(x) = e^{-2x} \\). Let \\( g \\) be the function given by \\( g(x) = x f(x) \\), and let \\( h \\) be the function given by \\( h(x) = \\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x} f(t)\\,dt \\)."
