               ],
               "criterion": "Gives all four terms 1 - 2x + 2x^2 - (4/3)x^3, as a sum or a list; unsimplified coefficients such as (-2)^2/2! are accepted, and a response carrying a fifth term as part of the answer does not earn the point.",
